 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "elements is a list of [id, p1, p2, p3] where id is a unique integer and p1, p2, p3 are strings. Two elements are directly related when they have the same value in the same property position (p1 with p1, p2 with p2, p3 with p3). Groups are the connected components of this relation (relatedness is transitive). Return every group as the ascending list of its ids, groups ordered by their smallest id; an element related to no other forms a group of one.",
